<title>USA: TABLE - Carolina Power Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Carolina Power Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.37		    $0.42</p>
<p> Net			 54,300		   62,700</p>
<p> Oper revs		666,023		  685,968</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 143,475		  143,808</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Caroline Power &amp; Light.</p>
<p>The company said &quot;unusually mild weather&quot; caused lower revenues and earnings in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The impact of milder weather, compared to normal, was $0.05 per share, and the impact of accounting adjustments was $0.11 per share, it said.</p>
</text>
